  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread mozzarella cheese, lardons, parsley, basil, and garlic onto the bamboo skewers.",
    "Drizzle the skewers with lemon juice and olive oil.",
    "Season the skewers with salt and black pepper.",
    "Place the skewers on a tagliere and serve immediately.",
    "Arrange the ingredients in a visually appealing way on the tagliere.",
    "Bake the skewers in the oven for 5 minutes to melt the cheese.",
    "Remove the skewers from the oven and let them cool for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the skewers hot and enjoy."
